---
description: Membership rules for the 7Oz Espresso Cafe platform.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Membership

Membership is a customer relationship feature.

Membership should never be tightly coupled with authentication.

Authentication identifies a user.

Membership provides benefits.

Treat them separately.

---

# Membership Card

Each member has:

Membership Number

Membership Tier

Join Date

Expiry Date (optional)

QR Code

Status

---

# Membership Tier

Supported tiers:

Bronze

Silver

Gold

Platinum

Future tiers should be configurable.

Never hardcode tier logic inside frontend.

---

# Membership Benefits

Benefits should come from database configuration.

Examples:

Discount

Birthday Reward

Priority Reservation

Exclusive Menu

Bonus Loyalty Points

---

# Upgrade

Membership upgrade rules belong to backend.

Frontend only displays results.

---

# Expiration

Membership expiration rules must be configurable.

Support lifetime memberships.

---

# QR Code

Every member should have a unique QR Code.

QR should never expose sensitive data.

Prefer tokenized identifiers.

---

# Customer Profile

Membership information belongs inside Customer Profile.

Do not duplicate membership data elsewhere.

---

# Future Ready

Gift Membership

Corporate Membership

Family Membership

Partner Membership